{"packet_id":"D042-01","doc_id":"D042","jurisdiction":"Los Angeles, CA","category":"rent_increase_limits","lifecycle":"enacted","title":"SCEP fee pass-through to RSO tenants","requirement":"A landlord of a registered RSO unit may collect the Systematic Code Enforcement Program fee from tenants at $2.83 per month for 12 months each year, in addition to rent, after written notice.","key_value":"$2.83/month for 12 months ($67.94 per unit)","coverage_conditions":"RSO rental units whose landlords register the units and give the tenant written notice.","applicability":{"built_on_or_before":null,"built_after":null,"date_basis":null,"min_units":null,"max_units":null,"owner_dependent":false,"other":"Units subject to the City of Los Angeles Rent Stabilization Ordinance (RSO)"},"exemptions":null,"penalty":null,"effective_date":"2022-01-01","citation":"City of Los Angeles Rent Stabilization Ordinance (RSO)","quoted_span":"SCEP Pass Through Amount: Effective January 1, 2022, the SCEP fee is a total of $67.94 per unit which landlords may collect from tenants at a rate of $2.83 per month for 12 months each year with a proper written notice.","interaction":null,"confidence":0.8,"conflict_flag":false,"conflict_note":null}
